<h2>Overview: Dallas enforces the 2021 ICC codes</h2>
<p>According to the City's <a href="https://dallascityhall.com/departments/sustainabledevelopment/buildinginspection/Pages/know_code.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Current City Codes and Ordinances</a> page, "2021 International Code Council codes are effective as of May 12, 2023." Each model code is adopted into its own chapter of the Dallas City Code with local amendments, so the Dallas version can differ from the ICC model text. The ordinance adopting the 2021 International Residential Code states that it takes effect on May 12, 2023. The fire code took effect a little earlier, on February 10, 2023, and the electrical code follows its own cycle.</p>
<p>As of our last review, the City had not posted an adoption of the 2024 ICC codes. When it does, the edition and effective date on this page will change, which is one more reason to check with the City before a project starts.</p>

